# Local install output. This repo tracks no lockfile, and an install here
# routes @nebulr-group through the local registry — so the file it leaves
# behind carries registry URLs and dev-only versions that must never be
# committed. Ignored rather than left untracked, so it cannot be swept into a
# commit by `git add -A`. If we ever decide to track a lockfile, remove this
# line and commit a freshly generated one from a clean install.
package-lock.json
